{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/4076e1741dc930c743fd7a484b80c0a2.poster.avif?t=1762901414\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/4076e1741dc930c743fd7a484b80c0a2.webm?t=1762901414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dark Legacy</strong> is a first-person psychological horror set in a decayed mansion and an abandoned hospital where the state once conducted secret experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a renowned brain surgeon, <strong>Dr. Victor Halberg</strong> lost touch with reality after the sudden death of his wife, turning his mansion into a dark laboratory. His obsessions and tragedy unearthed not only family secrets but also hidden government projects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are his estranged grandson, <strong>John Halberg</strong>. Drowning in debt, you return to sell the inherited estate. But behind the walls lies more than decay\u2026 a legacy that should have remained forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As night falls, the house awakens. And the deeper you descend, the shadows of the past drag you into a hospital the state tried to erase. There you will find not only traces of experiments, but echoes of screams on the edge of sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/a3ade709c37ba20963fc3404f4d1ccd3.poster.avif?t=1762901414\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/a3ade709c37ba20963fc3404f4d1ccd3.webm?t=1762901414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Gameplay</strong><br><strong>The Dark Legacy</strong> is a survival horror focused on exploration and tension.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mansion:</strong> Investigate secret rooms, gather notes and recordings, uncover family secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hospital:</strong> Follow the trail of state experiments, explore hidden laboratories, reveal buried truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles:</strong> Operate old machines, solve codes, navigate the dark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere:</strong> Every sound, shadow, and step brings you closer to forgotten fragments of the past.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every door hides a secret. Every room holds a deeper fear. And when the truth surfaces, you\u2019ll realize some questions are safer unanswered.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"No Escape","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679470/bc8b4f41937b7b09def4dec2852c61b1c6043dba.jpg"},{"name":"First Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679470/e3f6c5ba0431f1015978d03edcfa757b3078847f.jpg"},{"name":"Echos of the Past","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679470/bac1644d3dbc583814e343ed89a75e0c8d8b7b57.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3679470?t=1762901414","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/8bee9990588881eaea3992b4ff9b811031a686ee/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762901414","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/1c75a39acaee8009321c8d18b1ec31def0f89419/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762901414","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/1c75a39acaee8009321c8d18b1ec31def0f89419/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762901414","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The Dark Legacy contains strong psychological horror and graphic violence, including realistic blood and gore effects, sudden jump scares, and unsettling ambient audio. This game does not include sexual content, drug use, self-harm themes, or animal cruelty."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/4076e1741dc930c743fd7a484b80c0a2.poster.avif?t=1762901414\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/4076e1741dc930c743fd7a484b80c0a2.webm?t=1762901414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dark Legacy</strong> is a first-person psychological horror set in a decayed mansion and an abandoned hospital where the state once conducted secret experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a renowned brain surgeon, <strong>Dr. Victor Halberg</strong> lost touch with reality after the sudden death of his wife, turning his mansion into a dark laboratory. His obsessions and tragedy unearthed not only family secrets but also hidden government projects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are his estranged grandson, <strong>John Halberg</strong>. Drowning in debt, you return to sell the inherited estate. But behind the walls lies more than decay\u2026 a legacy that should have remained forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As night falls, the house awakens. And the deeper you descend, the shadows of the past drag you into a hospital the state tried to erase. There you will find not only traces of experiments, but echoes of screams on the edge of sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/a3ade709c37ba20963fc3404f4d1ccd3.poster.avif?t=1762901414\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/a3ade709c37ba20963fc3404f4d1ccd3.webm?t=1762901414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Gameplay</strong><br><strong>The Dark Legacy</strong> is a survival horror focused on exploration and tension.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mansion:</strong> Investigate secret rooms, gather notes and recordings, uncover family secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hospital:</strong> Follow the trail of state experiments, explore hidden laboratories, reveal buried truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles:</strong> Operate old machines, solve codes, navigate the dark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere:</strong> Every sound, shadow, and step brings you closer to forgotten fragments of the past.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every door hides a secret. Every room holds a deeper fear. And when the truth surfaces, you\u2019ll realize some questions are safer unanswered.</p>","developers":["Hollowseed","Berkay Guneri"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/5311d03718bfda3595fadea732f6ab24644480e1/header.jpg?